  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/AIOT/BH_AT_Header.png\" alt=\"標題\" width=\"1903\" height=\"592\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/AIOT/BH_AT_Overview.png\" alt=\"概述\" width=\"1903\" height=\"156\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MelanX/aiotbotania/1.16.x/images/item_overview.png\" width=\"685\" height=\"387\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">精靈鋤/AIOT 不僅能創造耕地，更能創造<em>超級耕地</em>。它不需要水源，也不會因為踩踏而變回泥土。而且還有粉紅色的閃光，<em>哇</em>！更多關於單一物品的資訊，請參閱<strong>植物魔法百科全書</strong>。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/MelanX/aiotbotania/raw/1.16.x/images/super_farmland.GIF\" width=\"500\" height=\"282\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/AIOT/BH_AT_Recipe.png\" alt=\"合成範例\" width=\"1903\" height=\"156\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">精靈 AIOT<br></span><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MelanX/aiotbotania/1.16.x/images/recipes/elementium_aiot.png\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">活木剪刀<br></span><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MelanX/aiotbotania/1.16.x/images/recipes/livingwood_shears.png\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">活石剪刀</span></span><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MelanX/aiotbotania/1.16.x/images/recipes/livingrock_shears.png\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fmelanx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/AIOT/BH_AT_PromoCard.png\" alt=\"廣告\" width=\"1903\" height=\"251\"></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">#廣告 #Ad</span></p><div>&nbsp;</div>",
